    verification d0104CorrectnessCritique : Test { :>> id = "63940516-2c7d-4e8f-eda4-5162738ea403"; :>> title = "Critique d0104 — correctness"; :>> createdAt = "2026-06-30"; :>> createdBy = "claudeOpus"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::critique; :>> lens = CritiqueLens::correctness; :>> critiquedBy = CriticKind::aiModel; :>> procedureText = "ATTACK: the heuristic mis-fires on a decision quoting ANOTHER decision's governance verbatim (D0104 itself hit this — reworded). Is it still correct? SURVIVED: the residual is acknowledged IN D0104's consequences + is exactly why the guard stays WARNING-level (not hard) — a rare false-positive a human clears at review, not a wrong commit-block. The heuristic correctly handles the real 4 cases + the genuine form. Correct for a warning-level signal; the limitation is documented, not hidden. No correctness defect."; }
