    verification issue127Disp1 : Test { :>> id = "f2f515dc-9dbb-4eed-a161-cf0e359df4b7"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::confirmation; :>> disposition = DispositionKind::act; :>> procedureText = "wweatherholtz, 2026-08-15, verbatim: 'accepted for all 62 also'. Given in direct reply to a report stating that 67 >= Medium findings remained undispositioned model-wide and that their earlier 'act on all' had been recorded against only the five findings they had been shown. STILL OPEN at the time of this verdict: 'critique-coverage counts superseded elements; coverage and tier-satisfaction do not'. ACT is therefore a FORWARD commitment to fix, carried by dcCritiqueCoverageSupersede, not a record of work already done."; }
