    verification issue132Disp1 : Test { :>> id = "fcf81d88-27ab-5888-8edd-bce080ab25f6"; :>> method = VerificationMethod::confirmation; :>> disposition = DispositionKind::act; :>> procedureText = "wweatherholtz, verbatim: 'on same machine'. Deck verdict: ACCEPT. Submitted by wweatherholtz in the obligations deck review of 2026-08-20. THE DECK'S VERDICT VOCABULARY IS Accept / Needs work / Reject, so the mapping to DispositionKind is stated rather than assumed: Accept -> act (the finding stands and something is to be done), Needs work -> act (it stands AND the current answer is insufficient, per their note), Reject -> dismiss."; }
